  "details": "An option to disable performance stat calculation on loading would be a good addition, especially for those of us who don't need to know the stats of every avatar we load and those on older hardware. The calculation makes loading super slow and cause very big lag spikes from the CPU usage (once again especially those on older hardware). An option to calculate certain people would work for the specific cases, possibly once you open the the stats menu it can re load the avatar to calculate for said person.",
